Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Climbing Up against All Odds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 47
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, I can protect everyone, just like Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bottomless Abyss is erupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, grab onto me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We really owe it all to Brother Dahuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,With Brother Dahuang guarding our village,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,we don’t have to be afraid of anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Dahuang is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great—thanks to Brother Dahuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to guard the village with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’m not strong enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you need to train even harder
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and become just as strong as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you can guard the village and save the world alongside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,With your level of power…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly get out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am standing right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…the best proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can’t even beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you can’t do it, why assume others can’t either?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be lying. You’re a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop deluding yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you, who wouldn’t even dare approach the edge of the Bottomless Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what right do you have to question me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually managed to climb up to this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we really can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were that simple to climb up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn’t have been trapped for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful—there are no handholds or footholds in this area; you can’t climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a sheer vertical drop further up; it’s unclimbable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Unclimbable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll just jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just now, while sliding down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that I realized it when my foot accidentally touched a falling piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As my body turned into lines, it became lighter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I’ve undergone some kind of change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the path ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been climbing for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,yet we still have so far to go; it’s as if we haven’t moved forward at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the most terrifying thing about the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try to climb up…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the way out feels as distant as the horizon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your spirit, time and time again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving you with a sense of helpless despair deep down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If everything could be accomplished easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,life would be so boring, wouldn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is only interesting when it’s full of challenges
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,More paper is drifting down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight—we’re setting off again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become stronger, so I can protect everyone just like you do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He reminds me of someone I used to know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown is working out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruption has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, everyone is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Dahuang fell into the rift while trying to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:06:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, I’m coming to save you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, this time it’s my turn to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.99,0:06:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown, grab hold of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown, do you remember the promise we made that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember. We were going to get stronger together…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,protect the village together, and save the world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t go back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Little Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown, you have to get stronger for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the village for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The terror of the Abyss Bottomless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you’re sucked in, there’s no getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your toughness is all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, you’ve long been terrified of the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t withstand a single one of my blows…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so why do you keep getting back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have companions to protect; I can’t fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Dahuang, I will definitely carry on your legacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,continue to protect the village, and keep getting stronger…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strong enough to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a way to help you protect your village
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of everything I protect, I must defeat you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t give up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to get everyone out, and I will
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single one left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally remember who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let us help you too, Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.95,0:09:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let’s help Sparky together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept this power of ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more step!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I break through this layer, I can summon my Protagonist Aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely won’t let your kindness go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Protagonist Aura…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me I don’t deserve the Protagonist Aura?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I already faded away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven’t I fallen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s my aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, I still have the protagonist’s aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let’s charge out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottomless Abyss together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Protagonist Aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead us toward the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice…could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you’d become this strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are actually still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who saved us from the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But…with so little power, how could he…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We had already given up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Quietly waiting to fade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was his refusal to give up that let us see hope again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? How does he possess such indomitable strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Brown, he achieved what none of us could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He pulled it off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He holds infinite possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can help us save this world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in and save him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
